If your SharePoint list will grow beyond 500 records, replace:

CountRows(
    Filter(...)
) > 0

with:

!IsBlank(
    LookUp(
        'SE Evaluation List',
        Sections = Dropdown_Section.Selected.Title &&
        'Created By'.Email = User().Email &&
        FiscalYear = varFiscalYear
