Since your Gallery_Method is displaying records from SE Question List, and each row has a comment textbox (txt_Comment_1), the easiest approach is to loop through all gallery rows and save them into SE Evaluation Method List when the user clicks btn_Submit_1.

btn_Submit_1.OnSelect

ForAll(
    Gallery_Method.AllItems,
    Patch(
        'SE Evaluation Method List',
        Defaults('SE Evaluation Method List'),
        {
            SectionInCharge: "ISD",
            QuestionNo: ThisRecord.QuestionNo,
            Comment: txt_Comment_1.Text
        }
    )
);

Notify(
    "Evaluation Method saved successfully.",
    NotificationType.Success
);


---

Explanation

For each row in Gallery_Method:

Source Control	Destination Column

"ISD"	SectionInCharge
ThisRecord.QuestionNo	QuestionNo
txt_Comment_1.Text	Comment


Example:

Gallery Data

QuestionNo	Comment

Q001	Need calibration certificate
Q002	Supplier submitted documents
Q003	Follow-up required


Saved to SE Evaluation Method List

SectionInCharge	QuestionNo	Comment

ISD	Q001	Need calibration certificate
ISD	Q002	Supplier submitted documents
ISD	Q003	Follow-up required



