Otherwise every click of Submit will create duplicate records.

For a Supplier Evaluation System, I would recommend:

SE Evaluation Method List

Column	Type

EvaluationID	Single line of text
Supplier	Single line of text
SectionInCharge	Single line of text
QuestionNo	Single line of text
Comment	Multiple lines of text
EvaluatedBy	Person or Single line
EvaluationDate	Date/Time


This will make reporting in Power BI much easier later.


